  "id": "underdog",
  "term": "underdog",
  "definition": "An underdog is a person or group seen as being at a disadvantage in a competition while still making strong, persistent efforts. In psychology-related discussion, underdog status is linked with greater sympathy from others than an advantaged “top dog.”",
